# VectorNav golden frames: SYNTHETIC, generated from tests/unit/vectornav/helpers.py, NOT a
# capture from a unit (there is no VN-200 on the bench). The helpers and parse.py encode the
# SatInfo/RawMeas/TimeUTC layouts from the same reading of the docs (all # VERIFY), so this
# file catches helper/parser drift, not a shared misreading of the protocol. Add a real
# VN-200 capture as a separate hardware-sourced fixture when a unit is available.
# Hex, 32 bytes per line; '#' starts a comment. Regenerate with the helpers if the field
# layouts change (test_golden_fixture_is_current checks they agree).
